#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/xdg-desktop-portal-wlr.xml:25
#, xml-text
msgid "Introduction to xdg-desktop-portal-wlr"
msgstr "Introdução ao xdg-desktop-portal-wlr"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/xdg-desktop-portal-wlr.xml:28
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The xdg-desktop-portal-wlr package provides the screenshot and screencast "
"portal interfaces for wlroots compositors. Most of the other portal "
"interfaces are provided by <xref linkend=\"xdg-desktop-portal-gtk\"/>, but "
"isn't strictly required unless you need those interfaces."
msgstr ""
"O pacote xdg-desktop-portal-wlr fornece as interfaces de portal para captura"
" de tela e gravação de tela para compositores wlroots. A maioria das outras "
"interfaces de portal é fornecida pelo <xref linkend=\"xdg-desktop-portal-"
"gtk\"/>, mas não é estritamente exigido, a menos que você precise dessas "
"interfaces."

